{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "00175ac22e5c223a625ffd079fab6500bf0da385d9bb0c41fcb16c828cc38152", "ja": "妖精たちの活動方針", "zh": "妖精们的活动方针", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82093c41a0667adec6bbf44fc60b479df2f6f2be28339d5b8f22fbf31072ac6c", "ja": "レッスン中、Fairyの公演を\n成功させるため色々と話し合う恵美、歩、\n志保、ジュリア。律子の助言を受けた4人は\nトーク・ダンス・ボーカルの全てを、\n自分達の課題として据える。", "zh": "在训练课程中，为了让Fairy的公演成功，\n惠美、步、志保和茱莉亚进行多方讨论，\n四人听过律子的建言之后，将谈话、舞蹈和\n歌唱全部视为自己的课题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d78887e1f17edc9cf2150333ddd9abf6b6452615cea09e74de10e1aebca99dba", "ja": "（Fairyチームのお披露目公演が決まって以来、\nメンバーのモチベーションは高まるばかりで……）", "zh": "（自从Fairy队首次亮相公演定案，\n成员的士气是越来越高昂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d59815f3b7103b2155bfbb19d5183dbbb2a8f19f325d628802fe99dcfc619ee9", "ja": "（レッスンの合間も、公演の話で持ち切りのようだ）", "zh": "（训练课程的休息时间似乎也总是在讨论公演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "36410f214d16672431406ffdf4f60f1f2e670667231f120711e88956c5451d36", "ja": "Fairy、Princess、Angel。\n3つのチームの中で、ウチらがトップバッターだ！", "zh": "Fairy、Princess和Angel，\n这三个分队中我们要打头阵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "37abf39b5d3f4cd6be75dbf235e52969d2e534a257a60c3137c6aa54e6ba7eea", "ja": "やるからには、絶対成功させようぜ！\nく～、ゾクゾクするな！", "zh": "既然要做，我们就一定要成功！\n呼～真是令人兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9df19066f38a7ee44646bf4e5e553115d11d760b5c7c57bcebe1c9c569f2506a", "ja": "にゃははっ、ジュリア燃えてるね～。わかるよ～、\nやりたいこといっぱいあって、そわそわしちゃうよね♪", "zh": "呀哈哈，茱莉亚好热血呢～我懂～\n有好多事情想做，会一直坐立难安吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "756dfb78f8546c5684f01a910d56f6890c871a1c11052dc6f37e92b1a26321a4", "ja": "ねえねえ、みんなは、ステージでどんなことやりたい？", "zh": "欸欸，大家想在舞台上做些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6b156a029c16f13ca42b82ca3bc2ce7d6e8cdd238b49bddca27c190d44f4af5d", "ja": "そりゃ、やっぱりお客さんもアタシ達も、\n思いっきり盛り上がれるようなことがしたいよな！", "zh": "那当然是想做能让观众和我们\n都尽情嗨一场的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "53b5a327aeaf14705eb730ca068a6e4844f708a7ba781db11e0545ea2b086473", "ja": "だよね！　やっぱアレかな、ド派手な演出とか！", "zh": "就是说啊！像是超华丽的舞台效果之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "bbccf2b89fce14af12367316cd33a8a58d7cbdc16691520c314e837d9ec89d5f", "ja": "演出を凝るのもいいですけど、\nまずは基礎を固めるべきだと思います。", "zh": "加强舞台效果也很好，\n但我想应该要从打好基础开始才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "c5eefecb73f3b3f16cf5b97bc398ff469bff99842aa55ba3ba87cb1363f8145b", "ja": "いくら演出がよくても、\n歌やダンスで失敗したら台無しですから。", "zh": "无论效果做得多好，\n要是在歌唱或舞蹈上失败就功亏一篑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "2f630abfcb8d81abed0e538cc87e2dbe4594165da8f90d5e7463dec39604d3dd", "ja": "志保は相変わらず真面目だな～。もちろん、歌もダンス\nも決めるとして、他にもいろいろやってみたいじゃん♪", "zh": "志保还是这么认真啊～歌舞当然都要练好，\n但除此之外也想做各式各样的尝试嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "790fc42780e0f53f4c497d6e9cbb3c79d5e020c93a6646622167e025a8dd724c", "ja": "歌とダンス以外……。\nまあ、ずっと歌ってるわけにもいきませんけど……。", "zh": "歌唱和舞蹈以外……\n也是，也不能一直都在唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ba1b0d69049c593caff416f3cb689be80503d0711066e7bbf3914ba9392f454", "ja": "（いい感じに盛り上がってるな。\n多少浮ついているぐらいが、前向きでいいというか）", "zh": "（讨论得很热烈呢。\n虽然大家多少有点躁动，但这么积极也好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2e1cec7be332f57362a6056bc3bf6a4b2f3cd7a2efdccb7e3aaccf04b865f076", "ja": "あら、あなた達だったのね。\n楽しそうな声が外まで聞こえてたわよ。", "zh": "哎呀，原来是你们呢。\n从外面就能听见开心的说话声了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f3ad9c5ea81d3713eebde7918f001543eeed1bef22e89b94c5829ef3c518ad46", "ja": "あれ。律子、なんでここにいるんだ？\n今日は確か、雑誌の取材が入ってたんじゃないか？", "zh": "奇怪了，律子，你为什么会在这里？\n今天不是有安排杂志取材吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "724c00b32a654118f8177c0f20aadc3a612c0d8ae0964854371a7d21b3a3172c", "ja": "あはは、実は忘れ物をしちゃって。\nちょっと取りに来たんです。", "zh": "哈哈，其实是我忘了带东西，\n过来拿一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "7bb86782bfe37875f0809920c05969641fa675160d8fdf647fecc4294951770c", "ja": "それで、みんなは何の話で盛り上がってたの？", "zh": "所以大家在热烈讨论什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fd31d9eb4f7a4714159d37c3914503c6b2ef9646a29858113f9a340e2bd71f80", "ja": "もちろん、今度のFairy公演の話！\nどうやって盛り上げようかって相談してたんだ！", "zh": "当然是这次的Fairy公演！\n我们在讨论怎么炒热气氛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "1146293026de9eb42b17c4fc72df33e4f754c90a68c8349154a92c44ace3eeb5", "ja": "って、リツ姉もFairyだよな？\n公演をド派手に盛り上げる、いい方法とか知らないか？", "zh": "是说，律姊也是Fairy对吧？\n你有没有能让公演嗨翻天的好方法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "2fbfe92b6a932c5c787e67e99ed98fcb21db811ee23b805eb818db263003c72f", "ja": "そんな都合のいい方法、知らないわよ。アイドルは\n黙って、最高のパフォーマンスを目指すのみ！", "zh": "我才没那种可以便宜行事的方法呢。\n偶像要做的只有全神贯注、以最棒的演出为目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "9af2025ef7c9afe9a4fb1e1ddd028325fd31e9041d69dada6d040d80d727ac10", "ja": "だからって、やみくもに頑張るっていうのもダメよ？\nそんなの疲れるだけで、効率も悪いし。", "zh": "即使如此，努力也要有个方向，不能横冲直撞喔。\n那只会徒增疲劳，效率也差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "ed30da5165022a99aa32902bdf917d8dd3425a7878ca8f738cd9f0d88531268a", "ja": "大事なのは、まず課題を明確にすること。\n明確な目標なくして、明確な成果は得られません。", "zh": "最重要的，首先是明确找出课题。\n如果没有明确的目标，也无法得到明确的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "81b9c51efd6c64f0491297ffb4aea34785d40671b8a6b5a262f8655bd67e31f1", "ja": "お～……！", "zh": "喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "81b9c51efd6c64f0491297ffb4aea34785d40671b8a6b5a262f8655bd67e31f1", "ja": "お～……！", "zh": "喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "81b9c51efd6c64f0491297ffb4aea34785d40671b8a6b5a262f8655bd67e31f1", "ja": "お～……！", "zh": "喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "dc7010caeb0dd6c1a753f31325f9fc60c990175f927aeead7aed1202c828cad1", "ja": "いや、さすがリツ姉だな。\nなんていうか、言葉に重みがあるぜ！", "zh": "真不愧是律姊。\n该怎么说呢……字字句句都很有份量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bdf98dd8aba7cac3ef08e0d4a8a739eb3b44b2191c752dd318d15a0259278c8", "ja": "ふふ、まあね♪\nこれでも、それなりに場数を踏んでますから。", "zh": "呵呵，算是吧♪\n别看我这样，也是经历了不少场表演呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7d6d0778c88d2ccd63c5c6304ac31467eb1a97cdf3cf5dfd9f09b9c7ab4d1bd3", "ja": "……心強いよ。つまり律子は、\n自分の課題を明確に把握してるってことだな？", "zh": "……真是可靠，这也就是说，\n律子你有明确掌握自己的课题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "dfbcd6f23aa03a4098d8d56fab844a6a6b922761da6ebb76c433626c96c8621c", "ja": "え！？　ああ、当たり前じゃないですか～！\nそりゃもう、バッチリシャッキリとですね……。", "zh": "咦！？是啊，那不是当然的吗～！\n当然是清清楚楚明明白白的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "0c53024c8d9d69c9d2789c9680d847b4ee1c710596957a858fd4346a5c9c41b3", "ja": "あーっと、もうこんな時間だわ！\nそれでは私は取材があるのでこの辺で。失礼しますっ！", "zh": "啊～原来已经这时间了！\n那我还有采访，就聊到这里。失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7678ed40695228db05207e7590c6ab74ca85a9b3d6f9db2fb7ae53adb6903b28", "ja": "あ、逃げた。", "zh": "啊，逃走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "eb0b9776bb3e9940bfb7b1a1240b3e16fb629600d0f3fdc7d0c4d0386d6d05a4", "ja": "……やれやれ。\nああいうところが、律子の課題かな。", "zh": "……真是的。\n那种地方可能就是律子的课题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "64839baeb955b2de820051098b183807aed76b8e6643072e2f55ff80be809aea", "ja": "にゃははっ♪　さすがの律子さんも\n{$P$}には敵わないんだね～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪就算是律子姊\n也敌不过{$P$}呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "214c613b8959f9c687b57609d8b68d4e128c08de9b11be8ea91aeb9eb783c21a", "ja": "はは、結構そうでもないぞ？", "zh": "哈哈，也不完全是这样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "d22507fa7b9fed9342fc7c1859d3951dc15429b5078e1a12530e8aa2967c0bb9", "ja": "でも、律子さんが言ってたことは\nもっともだと思います。", "zh": "但我认为律子姊\n说的话很有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6810203af1a79173468ba239160bb98f4bcdc5d1c1a6cc0d05b66664ceac0c0b", "ja": "そうだな。みんなは、公演を成功させるために\nクリアしなきゃいけない課題って、なんだと思う？", "zh": "是啊，大家认为要让公演成功，\n必须解决的课题是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1036_null", "source_sha256": "7a2249eeba29ac04758ad73d3eee9b149d1106579115b99d5a17a567c564342c", "ja": "トークでしょダンスだなボーカルだぜ！！", "zh": "是谈话吧是舞蹈啊是歌唱啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "c3410ac53e4de13555372dd2bb68ab3e534bd2badd090a76a963a9c1f9d8613c", "ja": "トークでしょ♪", "zh": "是谈话吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6d6d1ab1e0df83ed3fada8b87fab796c05992f32099b8f01967751ca2d9ea86a", "ja": "ダンスだな！！", "zh": "是舞蹈啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "5a2d8a626870b0bda48cde86ec0ce2716d609ea2f88e2aa42243a9dc81b4348d", "ja": "ボーカルだぜ！", "zh": "是歌唱啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "b04810c5cdc252955e4b8828fd431b6be71439224aa001365db3e677cf18990d", "ja": "見事に意見が割れたな……。", "zh": "意见果然不同呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "d3505a3a2cf5c79c0543f609811bab9b1a06eadb5bfcd1f6fa9220807394e16e", "ja": "はいはーい！　Fairyのトーク大臣といったら、\nこのアタシだよね！", "zh": "我说我说！要说Fairy最健谈的，\n就一定是我了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "7891bad1ce3bde0df859a119419b7ee656d49d0fc97197e3a16d21e61e1a1bbe", "ja": "MCって公演でチョー重要じゃん？\nだから、トーク力を磨いた方がいいと思うんだ！", "zh": "主持在公演中不是超重要的吗？\n所以我觉得训练口才比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "212276cd41f011b9376e9636e94b36c7b8a9d4ac9060334c0e2d1436485a1041", "ja": "いやいや、何を言ってんだか。\nなんてったってボーカルだろ？", "zh": "不不，你在说什么啊？\n不管怎么说都是歌唱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "40387d35e933b59df22f2e7d4c95ab43fda9c0b4ec0c7b8d28a448e60debcce5", "ja": "なんだったら、あたしがリードボーカルとして、\nみんなをガンガン引っ張っていくぜ！", "zh": "就由我来担任第一主唱，\n带领大家一起前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4d89474c0c3b63e9eb5d8884e4dcda6c466f158f387fb25d579ca3baf051e5d8", "ja": "ストーップ！　ジョークはそこまでにしてくれよな。\nステージはダンスから始まるんだっ！", "zh": "STOP──！玩笑话就说到这里了，\n表演是从舞蹈开始的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e09440ac3d7f191b1d9394d0a6e9d97061efaaf7b0b6f0e17a51d00cb3fca12c", "ja": "みんなでビシッ！ってキマった時の気持ちよさとか、\nホント、サイッコーなんだから！", "zh": "大家动作一致、跳出完美舞步，\n那时候的感觉真的非常爽快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "8ebc20632a7306d203a81ec0de11b25bb51272b771d2b0474243d90e37ba7c23", "ja": "つまり、トーク、ボーカル、ダンス、\n全部が課題ってことですね。先が思いやられ……。", "zh": "也就是说，谈话、歌唱和舞蹈\n全都是课题对吧？真是前途堪忧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1048_020meg", "source_sha256": "add78c4034dc4702b9b3eb5056e925084d816ee98d04fe344eee9bf6f57ea93f", "ja": "なるほど～～！", "zh": "原来如此～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "add78c4034dc4702b9b3eb5056e925084d816ee98d04fe344eee9bf6f57ea93f", "ja": "なるほど～～！", "zh": "原来如此～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "add78c4034dc4702b9b3eb5056e925084d816ee98d04fe344eee9bf6f57ea93f", "ja": "なるほど～～！", "zh": "原来如此～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "02a6f418a249143fbb49558f31b1c742f7e84f247f02677ee9c571b0309e03df", "ja": "は……？", "zh": "什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "4dd31043017b7c23ccfd5dc9272d5e48759202b39686e26cc7e9bb3e3484abab", "ja": "全部が課題って、わかりやすくていいね～♪", "zh": "全部都是课题呀，简单易懂，真好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "9d3118efd1c7d9a06f5443689df50e93d2400e84bcda0dc4429abc1b3a8e4d93", "ja": "だな。ひとつずつクリアしていくか！", "zh": "是啊，我们就一个个解决吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1054_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5034d9f69d7525a8d714167d00976d50fa9cbe285c774371ce5f421c94e97df9", "ja": "そうと決まったら、何から練習する？\nトーク？　ボーカル？　それともダンス？？", "zh": "既然这么决定了，那要从哪个开始？\n谈话吗？歌唱吗？还是跳舞？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1055_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1056_020meg", "source_sha256": "fd6e1d07a17374276f32e6afd88aecddc68881e8a87b855bc48f4bc06782e823", "ja": "ん？　なになに？　志保はトークから練習するって？", "zh": "嗯？什么什么？志保想从谈话开始练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "78e69665144dad08c8e93e49275bf08d6b0b6c4d393fe437c1d9f352519d988b", "ja": "言ってません。特にトークなんて、絶対に。\nダンスやボーカルはレッスンできますけど……。", "zh": "我可没说。尤其是谈话，绝对不要。\n跳舞和歌唱还能上课训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_02_1058_p", "source_sha256": "a3eb2909e1b8ad9e742cc3f7d96a4f68210f4091197f5bcb6f09284e0a1d3dcb", "ja": "（ともかく、方向性は決まったようだ。課題の克服を\n目指す彼女たちを、しっかりサポートして行こう！）", "zh": "（总之，大方向似乎是定下来了。\n她们是以解决课题为目标，我就好好给予支援吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
